&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a robust pipeline aligned to annual new logo revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate long buying cycles involving executive leadership, IT, compliance, risk, and procurement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Blend as a strategic platform partner, not just a point solution.&lt;/li&gt;
