&lt;li&gt;Drive pricing, contract negotiation, and deal structuring in partnership with Legal and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal and external stakeholders to move deals forward efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
